361
00:20:43,187 --> 00:20:45,827
Which is to say, more than 800 years ago.

362
00:20:46,047 --> 00:20:51,707
The message you read, he wrote to a mermaid princess who lived on this island during that time period.

363
00:20:51,707 --> 00:20:57,147
It is a letter of apology for failing to keep the promise he made to this island.

364
00:20:57,647 --> 00:20:58,367
What promise?

365
00:20:59,307 --> 00:21:02,447
I'm afraid that I don't know the specific details.

366
00:21:02,967 --> 00:21:08,507
But according to the legend, it's said that somebody will come to fulfill it someday on behalf of Joy Boy.

367
00:21:09,007 --> 00:21:12,527
At least that's the story that's been passed down through our royal family.

368
00:21:12,527 --> 00:21:15,827
And we firmly believe that this day will come.

369
00:21:16,267 --> 00:21:21,207
