389
00:22:42,567 --> 00:22:48,947
And now, Shirahoshi possesses the same power, so she will come to inherit the same name too.

390
00:22:48,947 --> 00:22:59,587
A terrible thing for a father to hear, but she is the ancient weapon.

391
00:23:01,347 --> 00:23:01,827
Poseidon.

392
00:23:01,827 --> 00:23:13,007
Jinbei reveals several surprises that occurred during the two years the Straw Hats were split up.

393
00:23:13,347 --> 00:23:17,587
After Whitebeard's death, his position as one of the four emperors was filled by an old enemy.

394
00:23:18,047 --> 00:23:22,387
The Navy also underwent a change, with a new leader emerging after a violent struggle.

395
00:23:22,707 --> 00:23:27,087
And while the crew learns of these troubling developments, Caribou planned some trouble of his own.

396
00:23:27,087 --> 00:23:34,407
